{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3058571","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【创作】2016年宝可梦音乐设计","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一介绍如何用音乐表现城镇、宝可梦中心、道路、战斗与洞窟等不同场景。","date":"2016-04-30","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン音楽は記号","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン音楽は記号","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3058571.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160502062046id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3058571.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":291,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3058571/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3058571/001-eb1130dbbb.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,848],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一介绍如何用音乐表现城镇、宝可梦中心、道路、战斗与洞窟等不同场景。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3058571/001-eb1130dbbb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3058571/001-eb1130dbbb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"848\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">只要听音乐\n就能明白身处的状况\n我会这样作曲\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n比如……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n城镇里\n因为宝可梦不会突然冲出来\n所以要作为让人安心的地方！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦中心\n\n总之就是安心又安全\n\n作为能够帮人恢复的地方！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        道路！\n道路要营造出冒险感，勇往直前！\n（初期是去邻镇买东西的感觉）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n战斗！\n战斗是和不可思议的生物\n怪物交战，所以要让人感到害怕！\n（不过它们会成为伙伴，这一点也要考虑进去）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n洞窟！\n因为怪物会从任何地方\n突然冒出来\n所以要营造出诡异的感觉！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n无论正在做什么、身处什么状况\n都要让任何人都容易理解……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n把它清楚地符号化\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不只是音乐\n角色设定和\n构成等方面\n也都可以运用\n所以请一定试试看哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3058571/001-eb1130dbbb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3058571/001-eb1130dbbb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"848\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">音楽を聞くだけで\n状況が分かるように\n作曲しています\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n例えば・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n街では\nポケモンが飛び出して来ないので\n安心な場所として！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nポケモンセンターは\n\nとにかく安心・安全\n\n回復してくれる場所として！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n        道！\n道は冒険感を出して勇ましく！\n（初期は隣町へのお買物な感じで）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n戦闘！\n戦闘は不思議な生き物\nモンスターと戦うので怖く！\n（でも味方になるのでそこも意識）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n洞窟！\nどこからでも\nモンスターが出てくるので\n不気味に！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何をしていてどんな状況か\n誰もが理解しやすいように・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n分かりやすく記号化する\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n音楽だけじゃなくて\nキャラクター設定や\n構成などにも\n使えますので\nぜひお試しくださいね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br></div>"}}